  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Waste_0-Explanation of Caddi lore
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Welcome to the Caddi\u2019s home galaxy. Its vast oceans and expansive forests
    were once a testament to their civilization."
  - "Processing\u2026"
  - "This is not as I recall. Something has changed.\r"
  - "Processing\u2026"
  - "No\u2026 this is impossible\u2026\r\n"
  - "Processing\u2026 oh..."
  - "The Caddi are gone. Extinct.\r"
  - "Their absence was inevitable, I suppose. It would explain why they abandoned
    this place so long ago.\r"
  - Analysis indicates a supernova event occurred here, destroying all traces of
    the Caddi. Only the golf course remains.
  - "The stars in this system are collapsing into black holes. I wonder what effect
    that will have on your ball.\r"
  - "I need to perform further analysis on these energy signatures. We\u2019ll discuss
    this later.\r"
  revealNameLater: 0
  hiddenSpeakerName: 
